  "details": "I'm wondering if VRC+ avatar slots can be replaced after the subscription is ended and the slots are locked. I like to add old favorites avatars to my favorite slots to use again but can't put them back. \n\nWhat I want is to be able to add that back to the same spot after taking out without having to re-sub. I wondered to keep the feature fair for subbed players, to have memory of the avatar being in the VRC+ saved slot earlier. So that a new avatar can be detected and can't be added to a VRC+ avatar slot. Maybe that can only be enabled after un-subbing to help with memory control.",
